Question Title-API-Service Directory Workflow
Question Link-https://my.newtonschool.co/playground/code/5ypni48t3pzs
Solution-cd api-service
git init
git add README.md
git commit -m "Add documentation"
git add server.js routes.js package.json
git commit -m "Add server files"
git status
git log
Approach-Firstly navigated to api-service directory using cd then initialized git usuing git init then staged the file README.md then commited it with the given message using git commit -m command then staged the given files and also committed it with the given message using git commit -m and as mentioned to use git status or git log once used it at the last.
